    "title": "iPhone Control Center iOS 16",
    "description": "<b>Control Center IOS 16 Style:-</b>\r\nThe Iphone Control Center IOS 16 has an easy-to-use, speedy and more customizable menus. You can have an experience of IOS 16 style in your Android Device. It also has wonderful Iphone 14 max style wallpapers.\r\n\r\nExperience Iphone Control Center in the style of iOS 16. You can use Control Center IOS 16 in your device from swiping from Edge which are situated at top, right, bottom and left. You can have the experience of the IOS 16 Style Control Center with this Control Center IOS 16.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features:-</b>\r\n- You can set different IOS 16 Style Wallpaper with this Iphone Control Center IOS 16.\r\n- Iphone Control Center IOS 16 allows you to Modify Settings on your fingertips.\r\n- Toggle Wifi, Bluetooth, Airplane mode from anywhere with an IOS 16 Control Center.\r\n- Iphone Control Center IOS 16 provides to toggle or set Screen rotation, Location, Flashlight, and Volume controls.\r\n- Add Favorite Apps in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.\r\n- Choose your wallpaper from a large list of IOS 16 Wallpapers, Transparent or even your Default Home wallpaper.\r\n- You can have an access to quick apps like calculator, camera, Alarm & Time from Iphone Control Center.\r\n- Iphone Control Center provides feature to adjust Brightness and Volume Slider.\r\n- You can open Battery Optimizations from IOS 16 Control Center.\r\n\r\n<b>Customize Edge Features:-</b>\r\n- Modify Edge Size and Stroke.\r\n- Customize Position of Edge like top, right, bottom or left.\r\n- Change color and alpha of Edge in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.\r\n- Open Settings from Iphone Control Center.\r\n- Organize Apps list in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Permissions:-</b>\r\n- We don't collect your personal data. We need some permission to do some actions. We don't collect your data with these permissions.\r\n- We need ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE permission is necessary and used only to perform global actions like Screenshots, Display app over Home Screen and etc. You need to grant this permission to use that action. The application commits not to collect or share any user information about this accessibility right.\r\n- We need QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES permission to let you select your favorite apps to add in Control Center.\r\n- We need OVERLAY permission to allow this app to show over other apps, change position, drag and drop.\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer:-</b>\r\nAll company, service and product names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, brands and trademarks does not imply endorsement.\r\nAll product names, brands, logos, trademarks and registered trademarks, which are not owned by us, are property of their respective owners.\r\nThe Iphone Control Center IOS 16 application is owned by us and is not an official Apple, iOS or iPhone application. We are not authorized, affiliated, associated, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with Apple, iOS and iPhone.\r\n\r\nThis Control Center app is a very feature-rich, easy and fast to use.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Control Center IOS 16 Style:-</b><br>The Iphone Control Center IOS 16 has an easy-to-use, speedy and more customizable menus. You can have an experience of IOS 16 style in your Android Device. It also has wonderful Iphone 14 max style wallpapers.<br><br>Experience Iphone Control Center in the style of iOS 16. You can use Control Center IOS 16 in your device from swiping from Edge which are situated at top, right, bottom and left. You can have the experience of the IOS 16 Style Control Center with this Control Center IOS 16.<br><br><b>Main Features:-</b><br>- You can set different IOS 16 Style Wallpaper with this Iphone Control Center IOS 16.<br>- Iphone Control Center IOS 16 allows you to Modify Settings on your fingertips.<br>- Toggle Wifi, Bluetooth, Airplane mode from anywhere with an IOS 16 Control Center.<br>- Iphone Control Center IOS 16 provides to toggle or set Screen rotation, Location, Flashlight, and Volume controls.<br>- Add Favorite Apps in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.<br>- Choose your wallpaper from a large list of IOS 16 Wallpapers, Transparent or even your Default Home wallpaper.<br>- You can have an access to quick apps like calculator, camera, Alarm &amp; Time from Iphone Control Center.<br>- Iphone Control Center provides feature to adjust Brightness and Volume Slider.<br>- You can open Battery Optimizations from IOS 16 Control Center.<br><br><b>Customize Edge Features:-</b><br>- Modify Edge Size and Stroke.<br>- Customize Position of Edge like top, right, bottom or left.<br>- Change color and alpha of Edge in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.<br>- Open Settings from Iphone Control Center.<br>- Organize Apps list in Iphone Control Center IOS 16.<br><br><br><b>Permissions:-</b><br>- We don&#39;t collect your personal data. We need some permission to do some actions. We don&#39;t collect your data with these permissions.<br>- We need ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE permission is necessary and used only to perform global actions like Screenshots, Display app over Home Screen and etc. You need to grant this permission to use that action. The application commits not to collect or share any user information about this accessibility right.<br>- We need QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES permission to let you select your favorite apps to add in Control Center.<br>- We need OVERLAY permission to allow this app to show over other apps, change position, drag and drop.<br><br><b>Disclaimer:-</b><br>All company, service and product names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, brands and trademarks does not imply endorsement.<br>All product names, brands, logos, trademarks and registered trademarks, which are not owned by us, are property of their respective owners.<br>The Iphone Control Center IOS 16 application is owned by us and is not an official Apple, iOS or iPhone application. We are not authorized, affiliated, associated, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with Apple, iOS and iPhone.<br><br>This Control Center app is a very feature-rich, easy and fast to use.",
